WEBVTT

01:24.840 --> 01:26.960
ADAPTED FROM THE LEGEND
OF KUNSHAN JADE BY TAN TIANYIN

02:06.480 --> 02:09.759
Yan Zijing, you've arrived in Wuling too?

02:12.120 --> 02:14.000
Master Yan, please wait a moment.

02:14.920 --> 02:16.400
He'll be here shortly.

02:29.840 --> 02:31.320
He's coming.

02:38.120 --> 02:39.160
Master Yue,

02:39.240 --> 02:41.320
Master Eight isn't well.
He'll see you later.

02:43.920 --> 02:45.200
Oh my…

03:00.760 --> 03:03.000
What an unexpected surprise!

03:03.600 --> 03:06.240
Why buy so many herbs
to ward off toxic air?

03:07.040 --> 03:08.000
Wuling is full of toxic air.

03:08.080 --> 03:09.000
Better safe than sorry.

03:14.040 --> 03:14.920
Mr. Cao.

03:17.120 --> 03:19.920
-Leader, I found out.
-Have some water.

03:23.960 --> 03:25.120
That guy's name is Lu Zhen.

03:25.800 --> 03:28.040
He's really had a rough life.

03:28.640 --> 03:30.000
Just like I did when I was young,

03:30.600 --> 03:31.880
he's suffered a lot.

03:32.560 --> 03:34.400
You don't know what my childhood was like.
Back in my childhood--

03:34.480 --> 03:35.600
Alright, let's talk about him.

03:35.680 --> 03:36.720
Okay.

03:37.600 --> 03:38.600
Originally,

03:38.680 --> 03:41.040
his father opened a small restaurant.
Life was going well.

03:41.120 --> 03:42.280
Then, one day,

03:42.360 --> 03:44.280
Heishan, one of Master Eight's men,

03:44.360 --> 03:45.880
claimed he broke a tooth
eating his baked flatbread.

03:45.960 --> 03:48.120
Heishan forced his father
to pay 100,000 mace.

03:48.200 --> 03:50.880
-That's outright extortion!
-Indeed.

03:50.960 --> 03:52.240
His father couldn't pay it

03:52.320 --> 03:54.360
and was driven to death over it.

03:54.920 --> 03:56.080
But it didn't end there.

03:56.160 --> 03:58.320
They even demanded Lu Zhen
keep paying, with interest.

03:58.400 --> 04:01.680
If he couldn't pay, his descendants
would have to keep paying.

04:01.760 --> 04:03.200
Unless he sold himself as a slave.

04:03.840 --> 04:05.280
But Lu Zhen's got a backbone.

04:05.360 --> 04:07.360
He told me he swore at his father's grave.

04:08.480 --> 04:09.400
In this life…

04:09.480 --> 04:10.920
Keep your voice down!

04:11.000 --> 04:12.440
…he would never be a slave.

04:12.520 --> 04:13.360
That's about it.

04:13.960 --> 04:17.240
But they're giving out food
and medicine here. People are living well.

04:17.320 --> 04:19.519
It doesn't seem like
what Lu Zhen described.

04:19.600 --> 04:22.560
He said in the past,
Wuling was nothing like this,

04:22.640 --> 04:23.800
but for some reason,

04:23.880 --> 04:25.360
about half a month ago,

04:25.440 --> 04:27.600
things suddenly changed
with all the aid being handed out.

04:27.680 --> 04:30.760
This place used to be like hell on earth.

04:30.840 --> 04:32.960
If you went to the mines,
you'd never come back.

04:33.040 --> 04:34.640
Master Eight's stone mines?

04:35.920 --> 04:38.520
Wait. You just said half a month ago…

04:39.200 --> 04:40.400
Why the change?

04:41.200 --> 04:42.400
I don't know.

04:42.480 --> 04:44.240
He just advised us
to leave Wuling quickly.

04:47.040 --> 04:48.720
I've got a bad feeling about Bafang Tower.

04:48.800 --> 04:51.280
Remind everyone in the convoy
to be on high alert.

04:51.360 --> 04:52.520
Don't worry.

04:52.600 --> 04:53.760
I'll patrol at night.

04:56.440 --> 04:57.880
I just took a look,

04:57.960 --> 05:00.840
and it's not easy to leave Bafang Tower.

05:00.920 --> 05:02.360
I'll check every exit of Bafang Tower.

05:02.440 --> 05:03.840
I won't even let a dog door slip by.

05:06.520 --> 05:08.360
I'll ask the Master when he returns.

05:08.440 --> 05:09.280
Alright.

05:13.400 --> 05:14.480
This way.

05:17.200 --> 05:18.080
Master Eight!

05:20.480 --> 05:22.840
Master Eight is unwell.
Say what you need to here.

05:27.880 --> 05:29.800
I'm not feeling well,

05:29.880 --> 05:32.280
and I'd hate to spread my illness
to a guest.

05:32.360 --> 05:34.360
May I ask who this esteemed guest is?

05:35.080 --> 05:38.240
This is a wealthy merchant
from the Western Regions,

05:38.840 --> 05:39.720
Master Yan.

05:40.840 --> 05:42.720
Greetings, Master Eight.

05:42.800 --> 05:45.960
My family has had some trouble,

05:46.040 --> 05:48.720
and I'm grateful to Master Yan.
He's willing to help me.

05:50.240 --> 05:53.120
Today, I brought him here to see you.

05:53.200 --> 05:55.000
Mainly to… I…

05:55.080 --> 05:56.080
Master Eight,

05:56.160 --> 05:57.560
he owes me ten million mace.

05:58.120 --> 06:00.000
I hope you can lend him a hand.

06:00.800 --> 06:02.960
With the friendship between us,

06:03.040 --> 06:05.080
a mere million mace…

06:05.600 --> 06:06.880
I'll lend it to you.

06:07.600 --> 06:08.560
Look at that.

06:08.640 --> 06:11.640
Master Eight
is really righteous and generous!

06:12.520 --> 06:15.040
I've heard that Master Eight
is immensely wealthy in Wuling.

06:15.560 --> 06:17.520
I came here on business,

06:18.040 --> 06:21.120
and I have a box of jewels.
I wonder if you'd be interested.

06:21.920 --> 06:23.240
Of course I am.

06:31.080 --> 06:34.000
Master Yan and Master Yue
are honored guests from afar.

06:34.600 --> 06:35.440
Here,

06:35.960 --> 06:38.160
have a taste
of our Wuling hospitality wine.

06:38.680 --> 06:40.320
Bring the wine!

07:12.440 --> 07:13.800
This is indeed fine wine.

07:15.080 --> 07:18.040
Master Yan, please enjoy.

07:31.200 --> 07:32.920
Master Yan, you're so straightforward.

07:33.720 --> 07:35.960
Name a price for that box of jewels.

07:36.840 --> 07:38.520
I'll take them all.

07:38.600 --> 07:39.760
Master Eight, you're truly bold,

07:40.280 --> 07:42.200
but this box of jewels
is already reserved.

07:43.280 --> 07:44.760
If you still want it,

07:44.840 --> 07:45.840
I can go back and prepare it

07:45.920 --> 07:47.880
and bring over some sketches and samples

07:47.960 --> 07:49.800
for you to choose from.

07:49.880 --> 07:50.920
Alright.

08:09.200 --> 08:10.720
Is this poison reliable?

08:11.680 --> 08:12.960
It's extremely potent.

08:13.040 --> 08:14.920
Master Eight brought it
from the Western Regions.

08:19.600 --> 08:21.200
You saw it earlier.

08:21.720 --> 08:23.680
Yan Zijing has quite a few jewels on him.

08:24.280 --> 08:26.360
Among those rare treasures he carries,

08:26.440 --> 08:28.920
the most valuable are Lingnan pearls.

08:29.440 --> 08:31.600
If you could get Yan Zijing's jewels,

08:31.680 --> 08:33.760
why would you need to guard

08:33.840 --> 08:35.039
these mines so diligently?

08:41.600 --> 08:42.799
Alright.

08:42.880 --> 08:45.680
The Bafang Tower guards
will take your orders for now.

09:08.080 --> 09:09.440
It's the poison
of the Black Dragon Bandits.

09:14.400 --> 09:15.760
Looks like Master Eight

09:16.280 --> 09:17.840
has always been connected
to the Black Dragon Bandits.

09:17.920 --> 09:19.920
I don't care about their connections.

09:20.440 --> 09:22.040
Don't you know
the state of your own health?

09:22.120 --> 09:24.040
Back when Li Kui
poisoned you several times,

09:24.120 --> 09:25.920
your body was already at its limit.

09:26.000 --> 09:27.480
Now, knowing it's poison,
you still drank it?

09:27.560 --> 09:28.480
Enough.

09:31.280 --> 09:32.560
Wuling is too strange.

09:33.080 --> 09:35.800
If I hadn't drunk that wine,
they'd definitely get suspicious.

09:37.680 --> 09:39.520
No one knows this poison
better than you and me.

09:40.720 --> 09:42.720
A few days and it'll be fine. Don't worry.

09:42.800 --> 09:45.360
It's still poison, though!

09:45.440 --> 09:47.000
Nothing ventured,

09:47.720 --> 09:48.640
nothing gained.

09:52.720 --> 09:53.840
Let's get to business.

09:55.440 --> 09:56.720
I need you to help me

09:57.480 --> 09:58.760
with three things.

10:01.000 --> 10:01.880
First,

10:03.720 --> 10:04.920
you personally lead people

10:05.600 --> 10:07.720
and find a place to hide my jewels.

10:10.960 --> 10:11.800
Second,

10:11.880 --> 10:13.000
look for an opportunity

10:13.520 --> 10:14.920
to get everyone out.

10:15.920 --> 10:17.680
I have a feeling

10:18.280 --> 10:20.720
that many things
are already out of my control.

10:21.840 --> 10:23.400
In this Bafang Tower,

10:24.280 --> 10:25.880
there should be another force at play.

10:26.480 --> 10:27.960
Why do you think so?

10:28.040 --> 10:30.480
We were given poisoned wine
as soon as we arrived.

10:31.720 --> 10:33.120
If there was no past grievance,

10:33.640 --> 10:35.120
why would it be so strange?

10:37.720 --> 10:39.800
You're using yourself as bait
to draw them out?

10:42.760 --> 10:44.400
What's the third thing?

10:45.440 --> 10:47.120
We've always known
the Black Dragon Bandits

10:47.200 --> 10:48.440
steal goods and people.

10:49.520 --> 10:52.560
There's a trail of goods,
but we can never trace the people taken.

10:53.120 --> 10:55.920
I've heard
the Wuling Mines are under tight watch,

10:56.720 --> 10:59.040
and Master Eight has ties
with the Black Dragon Bandits.

11:00.120 --> 11:01.400
What do you think

11:02.680 --> 11:03.720
they're trading?

11:06.040 --> 11:06.880
People?

11:37.320 --> 11:38.320
Master Eight,

11:39.600 --> 11:41.000
I came here

11:41.520 --> 11:43.400
because the Cui family
is on the brink of ruin.

11:43.480 --> 11:45.760
I have to gather the tribute pearls' value

11:46.280 --> 11:47.920
to save the Cui family from disaster.

11:48.600 --> 11:49.680
Rest assured.

11:49.760 --> 11:52.120
You are also one of the Cui family.
I won't kill you.

11:53.760 --> 11:55.400
But I need you to stay asleep.

11:56.680 --> 11:58.200
Rest well.

11:59.920 --> 12:01.000
Master.

12:03.600 --> 12:04.680
Master.

12:06.760 --> 12:07.760
Supervisor Kang,

12:08.280 --> 12:10.160
I need to speak with the Master.

12:11.000 --> 12:12.000
The Master is already resting.

12:12.080 --> 12:13.440
Resting this early?

12:13.520 --> 12:14.840
If it's not urgent, let's talk tomorrow.

12:14.920 --> 12:16.360
I feel that Bafang Tower

12:16.960 --> 12:17.880
isn't very safe.

12:17.960 --> 12:19.520
-Why don't we--
-It's nothing serious.

12:19.600 --> 12:21.040
The Master has his own plans.

12:21.640 --> 12:22.720
Then…

12:24.840 --> 12:25.800
Is Master Yan here?

12:25.880 --> 12:26.880
The Master is already resting.

12:26.960 --> 12:28.480
Master Eight sent me to collect

12:28.560 --> 12:30.240
the jewels Master Yan promised earlier.

12:30.320 --> 12:31.840
Let's discuss it tomorrow.

12:33.600 --> 12:35.000
I'll be on my way, then.

12:35.520 --> 12:36.680
Rest well.

12:43.320 --> 12:44.280
Here's the thing.

12:44.360 --> 12:46.800
Master Eight said
he'll buy all of Master Yan's jewels.

12:46.880 --> 12:48.480
For such a big deal,

12:48.560 --> 12:49.920
he still has time to rest?

12:52.320 --> 12:53.480
Please let Master Eight know

12:53.560 --> 12:55.640
I miscalculated the accounts earlier.

12:56.240 --> 12:57.520
All the jewels from this trip

12:57.600 --> 12:59.040
have already been spoken for.

12:59.680 --> 13:00.800
I'm afraid

13:00.880 --> 13:02.480
there are no spare jewels left
to sell him.

13:04.120 --> 13:05.600
Then I'll let Master Yan rest

13:05.680 --> 13:07.480
and report back to Master Eight.

13:07.560 --> 13:08.520
We'll await his decision.

13:25.120 --> 13:26.400
Leader, something's wrong!

13:26.480 --> 13:27.640
Thieves broke into the convoy.

13:27.720 --> 13:29.040
All the jewels are gone!

13:29.640 --> 13:30.640
Gone?

13:30.720 --> 13:31.760
And the thief?

13:31.840 --> 13:32.840
I have no idea.

13:35.480 --> 13:36.640
Call the Master.

13:39.920 --> 13:40.920
Master Shijiu,

13:41.480 --> 13:43.240
Yan's Trading Convoy lost the jewels.

13:53.480 --> 13:55.160
How did a thief get into Bafang Tower?

13:55.240 --> 13:56.800
Bafang Tower is heavily guarded.

13:56.880 --> 13:58.400
There's no way an outsider could enter.

13:59.400 --> 14:00.640
Then how did they lose them?

14:01.680 --> 14:03.160
Are you suggesting

14:03.720 --> 14:04.600
it was their own doing?

14:04.680 --> 14:07.000
Since Yan's Trading Convoy
lost the jewels,

14:07.080 --> 14:08.680
we're responsible.

14:09.480 --> 14:11.120
Starting now,

14:11.200 --> 14:13.720
seal off Bafang Tower. No one in or out.

14:13.800 --> 14:14.960
Anyone who disobeys

14:15.880 --> 14:16.840
will be killed.

14:17.680 --> 14:18.520
Understood.

14:20.000 --> 14:21.160
Master.

14:21.240 --> 14:22.360
Master.

14:29.400 --> 14:30.400
Continue.

14:31.440 --> 14:33.200
All the most valuable jewels are missing.

14:33.280 --> 14:35.840
Some of them
were already paid for with deposits.

14:35.920 --> 14:37.200
If we can't recover them,

14:37.280 --> 14:39.280
we may face
considerable compensation fees.

14:39.920 --> 14:41.120
What should we do?

14:42.160 --> 14:43.000
Once we leave Wuling,

14:43.080 --> 14:44.800
we'll be in the Master's territory
in the Western Regions.

14:45.320 --> 14:46.560
There, things can be handled.

14:47.720 --> 14:48.720
Yes.

14:48.800 --> 14:50.440
The Master has faced far worse crises.

14:50.520 --> 14:51.880
As long as he's here,

14:52.600 --> 14:54.120
he'll turn misfortune into fortune.

14:56.240 --> 14:57.280
Are you alright?

15:00.520 --> 15:01.360
For no reason,

15:01.440 --> 15:03.440
-why did the Master suddenly fall ill?
-It's nothing.

15:04.760 --> 15:05.760
Where's Supervisor Kang?

15:05.840 --> 15:06.960
Why isn't he here?

15:07.040 --> 15:09.320
He went to find medicine for me.
It's alright.

15:09.400 --> 15:10.600
Since Supervisor Kang isn't here,

15:10.680 --> 15:12.600
I'll stay and look after him.

15:13.920 --> 15:15.080
Let him rest.

15:17.880 --> 15:18.840
You may go now.

15:40.720 --> 15:43.120
You stayed back on purpose.
Do you have something to ask me?

15:44.640 --> 15:45.680
What's wrong?

15:48.080 --> 15:49.600
The convoy's jewels were stolen.

15:50.120 --> 15:52.040
You have always been thorough.

15:52.120 --> 15:53.840
How could something like this happen?

15:55.720 --> 15:57.160
Local power holds sway.

15:59.000 --> 16:00.480
Besides, I'm not feeling well.

16:04.640 --> 16:05.480
It's fine.

16:05.560 --> 16:07.400
I have medicine for the toxic air.
I'll get it for you.

16:07.480 --> 16:09.440
No need. Supervisor Kang went to get it.

16:09.520 --> 16:10.680
Then I'll go find a doctor.

16:10.760 --> 16:11.840
Come back!

16:13.080 --> 16:14.440
You can't leave now.

16:16.560 --> 16:18.000
What do you mean I can't leave?

16:37.560 --> 16:39.040
Master Eight ordered

16:39.120 --> 16:41.160
to seal off Bafang Tower immediately.

16:41.680 --> 16:42.640
No one in or out.

16:43.240 --> 16:44.720
We'll search everyone

16:44.800 --> 16:46.760
until we catch this thief

16:46.840 --> 16:49.280
and give Master Yan justice!

16:53.640 --> 16:54.720
How did you know?

16:54.800 --> 16:56.920
We were being watched
as soon as we entered Bafang Tower.

16:57.560 --> 16:59.040
Master Eight wants my jewels.

16:59.120 --> 17:00.760
Now that the jewels are gone,

17:00.840 --> 17:01.920
he won't let me leave.

17:03.800 --> 17:04.839
It's that simple?

17:07.240 --> 17:10.680
Search Yan's Trading Convoy
inside and out.

17:11.480 --> 17:12.760
I want to see

17:12.839 --> 17:15.240
-where this petty thief could be hiding.
-Yes, sir!

17:16.119 --> 17:17.400
What are you doing?

17:17.480 --> 17:20.079
All of you, stop!

17:20.160 --> 17:21.920
Why aren't you chasing the thief?
Why are you searching the victim's place?

17:22.520 --> 17:23.640
What kind of logic is this?

17:28.840 --> 17:30.760
I am the logic.

17:31.880 --> 17:33.880
It's up to the officials to handle this,

17:33.960 --> 17:35.080
not you.

17:37.840 --> 17:39.960
If something happens in Bafang Tower,

17:40.480 --> 17:41.880
it's up to Bafang Tower's people

17:41.960 --> 17:43.520
-to handle it.
-You…

17:55.480 --> 17:57.600
We searched everywhere. It's all empty.

18:01.840 --> 18:02.760
Where's the stuff?

18:02.840 --> 18:04.840
How would we know where it is?

18:04.920 --> 18:05.920
We should be asking you!

18:06.000 --> 18:08.920
The stuff was lost here in your place.
We should be asking you!

18:09.000 --> 18:09.920
Yeah.

18:10.000 --> 18:11.840
Where are our things?

18:11.920 --> 18:13.520
-Hand it over!
-Come on. Speak up!

18:15.000 --> 18:16.440
So, Yan Zijing,

18:16.520 --> 18:18.840
a wealthy merchant from the West,

18:19.360 --> 18:22.240
all your treasures
and Lingnan pearls are gone.

18:25.200 --> 18:26.520
All of you, stay here

18:27.040 --> 18:28.440
and protect Master Yan well.

18:28.520 --> 18:29.640
Yes, sir!

18:39.200 --> 18:40.280
Are you feeling better?

18:42.240 --> 18:43.120
I'm fine.

18:43.200 --> 18:44.480
The jewels probably
weren't stolen by them.

18:48.920 --> 18:49.960
Right.

18:51.120 --> 18:52.400
And where's Supervisor Kang?

18:53.400 --> 18:54.520
Is he

18:55.040 --> 18:57.480
not coming back
until he catches the thief?

19:02.560 --> 19:04.400
I sent him to hide the jewels.

19:07.800 --> 19:09.800
You're unusually honest this time.

19:10.440 --> 19:12.320
I know I can't hide things from you.

19:13.800 --> 19:17.680
But Master Eight is connected
with the Black Dragon Bandits.

19:18.920 --> 19:19.920
I know.

19:21.280 --> 19:23.520
You came to Wuling
just because of Master Eight.

19:24.120 --> 19:26.960
And you brought Master Yue along
just to gain access to Bafang Tower.

19:28.640 --> 19:30.160
But something unexpected happened.

19:30.760 --> 19:32.320
But how would Master Eight know

19:32.400 --> 19:33.720
there were colored jewels, Lingnan pearls,

19:33.800 --> 19:35.120
among ours?

19:35.200 --> 19:37.000
There's no way they could know that.

19:37.080 --> 19:38.680
That's why I suspect

19:39.200 --> 19:40.800
someone else

19:41.320 --> 19:42.200
is behind Master Eight.

19:42.280 --> 19:44.160
And it's well aware

19:44.680 --> 19:45.680
of your trips to Hepu

19:46.320 --> 19:47.720
and Guangzhou.

19:51.880 --> 19:53.760
Could Wuling have already changed hands?

19:54.400 --> 19:55.640
And the one behind this…

19:57.920 --> 19:58.840
is Cui Shijiu?

20:03.400 --> 20:04.480
Exactly.

20:08.760 --> 20:09.600
Master.

20:10.120 --> 20:11.280
Master.

20:12.240 --> 20:13.760
How did it get this bad?

20:13.840 --> 20:15.200
This doesn't seem like miasma poisoning.

20:16.640 --> 20:17.560
Are you feeling better?

20:17.640 --> 20:18.960
I was poisoned
by the Black Dragon Bandits.

20:21.000 --> 20:22.120
Poison from the Black Dragon Bandits?

20:22.640 --> 20:25.480
-When and how did it happen?
-It's fine.

20:26.000 --> 20:27.360
I'm used to it by now.

20:28.640 --> 20:30.240
What do you mean?

20:30.320 --> 20:31.920
I'll explain later.

20:32.640 --> 20:35.320
Come here.
I'll tell you where the jewels are hidden.

20:43.720 --> 20:46.120
When the time comes, take the jewels
and these people and leave first.

20:47.320 --> 20:49.680
I've arranged for Zhang Jinran
to come and meet you.

20:53.040 --> 20:53.920
And what about you?

20:55.000 --> 20:56.680
Master Eight wants these jewels.

20:57.200 --> 20:59.200
As long as he hasn't found them,
he won't harm me.

21:00.040 --> 21:01.960
Heishan is watching me.

21:02.640 --> 21:03.600
If I make a move,

21:04.120 --> 21:05.600
it'll be hard for you all to leave.

21:59.320 --> 22:00.280
Let's go!

22:01.040 --> 22:02.200
Keep quiet.

22:03.840 --> 22:04.680
Keep quiet!

22:05.360 --> 22:06.280
Get down!

22:10.400 --> 22:12.000
It's Supervisor Kang. Go.

22:13.720 --> 22:14.640
This way.

22:16.200 --> 22:17.360
Supervisor Kang.

22:19.960 --> 22:21.160
Move, quickly!

22:24.760 --> 22:25.600
Hurry!

22:54.360 --> 22:55.480
Mr. Zhang?

22:59.200 --> 23:00.440
Mr. Zhang.

23:00.520 --> 23:01.720
-Duanwu!
-Hurry!

23:02.320 --> 23:04.240
-Supervisor Kang. Du Ming, move!
-Quick!

23:04.320 --> 23:05.440
This way, hurry!

23:08.680 --> 23:10.480
-Let's go too, quickly!
-Mr. Zhang,

23:11.000 --> 23:12.360
I feel reassured with you here.

23:12.880 --> 23:14.200
Yan Zijing is sick.

23:14.280 --> 23:16.600
I can't leave him here alone. Thank you.

23:18.440 --> 23:19.480
Duanwu!

23:33.520 --> 23:35.920
-What's wrong?
-Why didn't you leave?

23:36.680 --> 23:37.880
How did it get so bad?

23:37.960 --> 23:39.400
I'm fine. You go first.

23:39.480 --> 23:41.240
I've taken the antidote.
I'll be fine in two days.

23:41.320 --> 23:43.040
If Master Eight finds out
that everyone's left

23:43.120 --> 23:44.080
and you're alone here…

23:44.160 --> 23:45.680
Didn't I tell you?

23:45.760 --> 23:47.400
Before he gets the jewels yet,
he can't kill me.

23:47.480 --> 23:48.640
-And what about Cui Shijiu?
-Listen to me.

23:48.720 --> 23:50.560
Won't Cui Shijiu try to kill you?

23:50.640 --> 23:51.960
She'd skin you alive if she could.

23:53.440 --> 23:54.720
I told you,

23:54.800 --> 23:56.280
I'll leave when Supervisor Kang returns.

23:56.360 --> 23:57.880
-You lie down first.
-Duanwu.

23:58.800 --> 24:00.040
Don't worry.

24:00.120 --> 24:01.800
I'll find a way to buy us time.

24:04.720 --> 24:06.040
You're burning up.

24:10.680 --> 24:13.360
-Master Yue! Master Yue!
-Oh, Miss Duanwu!

24:14.320 --> 24:15.200
Miss Duanwu.

24:15.280 --> 24:16.280
Something terrible has happened!

24:17.440 --> 24:19.360
Miss Duanwu, what's going on outside?

24:19.440 --> 24:21.480
Why have they surrounded my room?

24:22.000 --> 24:22.920
None of us can get out.

24:24.040 --> 24:25.760
-What's going on?
-Master Eight has hidden motives.

24:25.840 --> 24:27.080
He wants to seize the jewels
from our convoy.

24:28.480 --> 24:30.600
Oh… Who's spreading such nonsense?

24:30.680 --> 24:32.480
Since we arrived at Bafang Tower,

24:32.560 --> 24:34.640
have you ever seen his true face?

24:34.720 --> 24:35.560
You haven't, have you?

24:35.640 --> 24:37.560
There's definitely
something fishy going on.

24:37.640 --> 24:39.960
Now we're at their mercy.

24:40.880 --> 24:42.640
I came to tell you

24:42.720 --> 24:45.000
that you and I are in the same boat.

24:45.080 --> 24:46.520
You need to listen to me.

24:46.600 --> 24:48.080
This has nothing to do with me!

24:48.680 --> 24:50.800
We're not in the same boat.

24:54.640 --> 24:55.600
Fine.

24:56.480 --> 24:58.360
Then, think about this, Master Yue.

24:59.280 --> 25:01.800
If Master Eight truly kills and steals,

25:01.880 --> 25:03.080
what value

25:03.600 --> 25:04.920
would you have to him?

25:05.680 --> 25:08.440
The only thing waiting for you
is to be silenced.

25:10.040 --> 25:11.800
I'm not like you all.

25:11.880 --> 25:13.640
With the years of friendship between us,

25:15.280 --> 25:16.680
-he'd never kill me.
-Fine.

25:18.000 --> 25:19.440
Then don't be so hasty.

25:24.840 --> 25:26.760
Miss Duanwu,
if there's nothing else, please leave.

25:26.840 --> 25:28.200
I'd love to leave,

25:28.720 --> 25:29.920
but it seems to me

25:30.000 --> 25:31.920
you're not feeling well.

25:33.080 --> 25:34.320
You have a burning sensation
in your chest,

25:35.000 --> 25:36.480
and your throat feels tight, doesn't it?

25:38.320 --> 25:40.920
You…

25:41.880 --> 25:44.760
-What did you put in the tea?
-Poison.

25:44.840 --> 25:47.000
-You…
-I tried to reason with you.

25:47.080 --> 25:48.120
This was my only choice.

25:48.200 --> 25:51.120
You've harmed me! I…

25:51.200 --> 25:53.640
-I'll kill you!
-If you want the antidote,

25:54.720 --> 25:55.680
you have to listen to me.

25:56.280 --> 25:57.360
You…

26:04.080 --> 26:05.200
Fine.

26:05.280 --> 26:07.400
Master Eight,
Master Yue requests to see you.

26:18.840 --> 26:19.720
Let him in.

26:29.600 --> 26:31.480
I must see Master Eight.

26:32.200 --> 26:34.600
Master Eight is resting.
What's the matter?

26:38.960 --> 26:42.080
I'd like to discuss
a business deal with him.

26:44.840 --> 26:47.400
It's about Yan Zijing's jewels.

26:49.600 --> 26:52.240
Yan Zijing's jewels have been stolen.
Get out.

26:53.560 --> 26:56.200
Who would be so bold

26:56.280 --> 26:57.840
as to steal from Bafang Tower?

27:02.680 --> 27:03.880
What's that supposed to mean?

27:04.520 --> 27:06.040
Do you think it was us?

27:06.640 --> 27:07.920
Of course not.

27:11.760 --> 27:14.000
It was Yan Zijing himself.

27:15.040 --> 27:17.280
His people couldn't have left.

27:20.000 --> 27:22.080
You know where the jewels are?

27:23.480 --> 27:24.760
Speak clearly.

27:25.360 --> 27:27.040
Since it's business,

27:27.560 --> 27:30.520
we should discuss the terms first.

27:30.600 --> 27:33.440
-You're asking for death.
-Wait.

27:41.480 --> 27:42.320
Cui Shijiu!

27:43.840 --> 27:46.120
How… How are you here?

27:47.080 --> 27:49.360
The Wuling Mines belong to my Cui family.

27:49.440 --> 27:50.800
Why wouldn't I be here?

27:51.920 --> 27:53.720
I'll do business with you,

27:53.800 --> 27:54.880
but I need to know,

27:54.960 --> 27:56.920
how are you so certain
of where Yan Zijing's jewels are?

27:58.280 --> 28:01.240
If I tell you where the jewels are,

28:02.520 --> 28:03.920
will I still be alive afterward?

28:05.200 --> 28:06.480
I, Cui Shijiu,

28:07.880 --> 28:09.240
keep my word.

28:09.320 --> 28:11.160
Then, shouldn't we

28:11.720 --> 28:14.960
first clarify the profit
split on these jewels?

28:17.600 --> 28:19.440
If I don't speak,

28:19.520 --> 28:22.160
you won't get anything.

28:22.240 --> 28:23.840
If you want me to lead the way,

28:23.920 --> 28:25.640
then you'll have to pay for it.

28:26.400 --> 28:30.280
Every inch of Wuling
belongs to Master Eight,

28:30.360 --> 28:32.040
especially those jewels.

28:33.520 --> 28:34.360
Right.

28:34.440 --> 28:38.160
The Cui family can dig up all of Wuling,

28:38.240 --> 28:40.600
but how much time would that take?

28:40.680 --> 28:41.840
The manpower, the resources…

28:41.920 --> 28:43.640
With me, you won't need that.

28:43.720 --> 28:44.760
Just give me enough people,

28:44.840 --> 28:47.800
and I guarantee we'll find it tonight.

28:47.880 --> 28:49.240
Eighty-twenty split.

28:49.760 --> 28:51.200
You get 20, I get 80.

28:51.280 --> 28:52.240
And that money

28:52.760 --> 28:55.240
is what'll keep you alive out of here.

28:59.680 --> 29:00.560
Fine.

29:01.080 --> 29:03.400
Give me more men. Right away.

29:03.480 --> 29:04.920
But Master Yue,

29:05.920 --> 29:08.720
if you're deceiving me
at this critical moment,

29:09.640 --> 29:11.040
there won't be a trace of you left.

29:11.640 --> 29:12.640
Of course.

29:12.720 --> 29:14.800
Let's go. Lead the way.

29:37.680 --> 29:38.840
Is it here?

29:46.200 --> 29:47.840
We found it!

29:55.320 --> 29:57.480
I told you it was here,
and you didn't believe me.

29:58.280 --> 29:59.480
Dig faster!

30:00.120 --> 30:01.560
Quickly. Keep digging!

30:01.640 --> 30:02.680
Keep going! Faster!

30:04.280 --> 30:05.400
Over there. Dig faster!

30:09.600 --> 30:12.160
Are the poison effects kicking in?

30:21.080 --> 30:21.920
Are you still feeling unwell?

30:25.000 --> 30:26.040
Much better.

30:35.560 --> 30:36.920
How did you get poisoned
by the Black Dragon Bandits before?

30:41.400 --> 30:42.640
They once held me captive

30:44.920 --> 30:45.760
for eight years.

30:56.640 --> 30:57.920
You little brat,

30:58.000 --> 30:59.360
dare to run again?

31:00.000 --> 31:00.960
Let's go!

31:02.400 --> 31:04.920
Every moment, I wanted to escape.

31:05.840 --> 31:07.360
Even if it meant breaking my bones

31:07.960 --> 31:09.240
or fighting dogs for scraps…

31:10.280 --> 31:11.640
I just wanted to see the sun again.

31:59.960 --> 32:02.200
Kid, you think you can escape?

32:02.280 --> 32:04.040
Let's see if you can survive this beating!

32:14.720 --> 32:19.320
I did everything I could to survive,
even if I had to struggle like an animal.

32:23.120 --> 32:24.480
Eight years of captivity,

32:25.320 --> 32:26.440
escaping,

32:26.520 --> 32:27.400
getting beaten,

32:27.920 --> 32:28.760
locked away.

32:29.280 --> 32:30.160
Just like that.

32:54.680 --> 32:55.880
I'm fine now.

33:00.360 --> 33:02.680
Master Yue has deployed
all of Bafang Tower's men.

33:02.760 --> 33:03.600
Rest easy.

33:30.840 --> 33:32.880
Yan Zijing's jewels aren't just these.

33:32.960 --> 33:35.520
Anyway, their lives are in our hands,

33:36.040 --> 33:37.800
and the jewels are still in Wuling.

33:37.880 --> 33:38.840
No rush.

33:40.360 --> 33:41.360
Alright.

34:24.000 --> 34:25.040
Cui Jia!

34:54.600 --> 34:56.080
Not a single drop of your medicine

34:57.120 --> 34:58.880
entered my stomach.

34:59.840 --> 35:01.480
It's actually fun

35:01.560 --> 35:03.000
toying with you.

35:03.600 --> 35:06.280
Look, you even lured
in a fat sheep for me.

35:08.440 --> 35:09.880
Your father has raised

35:09.960 --> 35:12.240
such a vile creature.

35:12.320 --> 35:14.640
You dare plot against your elders?

35:15.560 --> 35:16.760
Such disrespect!

35:17.960 --> 35:20.000
You little girl

35:20.080 --> 35:22.120
trying to act like a man?

35:23.520 --> 35:26.160
Has Cui Jingchu run out of sons?

35:27.680 --> 35:29.880
My mistake was not killing you.

35:43.960 --> 35:44.880
You're back!

35:44.960 --> 35:46.880
Didn't we agree on two days?
Why did you return today?

35:47.480 --> 35:49.360
Your orders

35:49.440 --> 35:51.560
had to be completed early.

35:52.080 --> 35:52.920
And guess what?

35:53.000 --> 35:56.320
I ran into Cui Shijiu this time.

35:57.600 --> 35:59.480
Miss Duanwu,

35:59.560 --> 36:01.680
see how obedient I am?

36:01.760 --> 36:03.760
This counts as a contribution, right?

36:03.840 --> 36:06.480
So, please, give me the antidote.
I'm nearly at death's door!

36:06.560 --> 36:07.840
There's no antidote.

36:07.920 --> 36:09.280
Please hand over that antidote…

36:09.360 --> 36:10.960
There's no poison.
What antidote do you need?

36:11.560 --> 36:13.720
Who said no poison? I'm itching all over!

36:13.800 --> 36:14.760
I'm telling you,

36:14.840 --> 36:15.800
if you don't leave now,

36:15.880 --> 36:16.880
it'll really be too late.

36:16.960 --> 36:18.000
Go quickly!

36:18.080 --> 36:19.200
Duanwu.

36:20.120 --> 36:21.280
-Supervisor Kang.
-Leave!

36:25.040 --> 36:25.960
They're all safe?

36:26.040 --> 36:27.640
They're all fine, rest assured.

36:27.720 --> 36:28.920
Where's the Master?

36:29.000 --> 36:30.160
He's in his room.

36:30.960 --> 36:32.560
I just came from his room,
and I didn't see him.

36:32.640 --> 36:34.440
He was on the bed when I left.

36:42.640 --> 36:44.080
Cui Shijiu…

36:45.960 --> 36:47.760
Do you know where Master Eight lives?

36:50.120 --> 36:51.240
Be careful.

37:04.200 --> 37:05.400
Cui Shijiu.

37:06.160 --> 37:07.320
So, it really is you.

37:07.920 --> 37:09.840
Why are you here alone?

37:10.440 --> 37:11.280
Where's Yan Zijing?

37:12.720 --> 37:14.120
Yan Zijing has gone missing?

37:15.280 --> 37:17.360
It's your duty to keep an eye on him.

37:17.440 --> 37:18.680
Why ask me?

37:18.760 --> 37:19.960
Stop pretending.

37:20.600 --> 37:22.400
Who else but you would want

37:22.480 --> 37:24.120
-Yan Zijing dead?
-Nonsense!

37:24.200 --> 37:25.960
Bafang Tower is full of traps

37:26.040 --> 37:27.520
and heavily guarded.

37:27.600 --> 37:29.440
Even if he had wings, he couldn't escape.

37:29.520 --> 37:32.440
He once faked Wei Yan's death to trap me,

37:32.520 --> 37:33.800
then used an official auction

37:33.880 --> 37:35.320
to cheat my Cui family out of everything.

37:35.960 --> 37:37.760
He left my family in massive debt.

37:37.840 --> 37:39.240
If I caught him,

37:39.320 --> 37:40.640
why would I hide him?

37:40.720 --> 37:43.280
I'd have killed him outright!
I wouldn't wait for you to ask me.

37:43.360 --> 37:45.440
Fortunately,
my family has a century of foundation,

37:45.520 --> 37:46.360
wealth amassed over generations.

37:46.440 --> 37:47.680
You think

37:48.480 --> 37:50.840
there's no one behind me?

38:01.800 --> 38:02.880
Duanwu, let's go!

38:20.360 --> 38:21.520
Duanwu!

38:22.600 --> 38:23.640
Duanwu!

38:30.360 --> 38:32.760
Wake up! Wake up!

38:40.200 --> 38:42.440
Hurry up. What are you dawdling for?

38:44.440 --> 38:45.520
Still slacking off?

38:45.600 --> 38:46.480
Get up!

38:46.560 --> 38:47.640
Get up!

38:51.080 --> 38:52.480
Dead. Dump him.

38:56.160 --> 38:57.000
Move aside!

39:00.640 --> 39:03.040
Hurry up! Move it!

39:20.560 --> 39:21.880
Cui Jia!

39:21.960 --> 39:23.240
Honored guests,

39:23.920 --> 39:26.600
cool your tempers in this mine

39:26.680 --> 39:27.920
and serve Master Eight well.

39:32.480 --> 39:33.400
Heishan!

39:33.480 --> 39:36.040
You're too bold.
This is Master Cui Shijiu!

39:37.760 --> 39:39.560
Here, it's Master Eight's domain.

39:40.080 --> 39:43.560
I don't care
if you're Master Shijiu or Lady Shijiu,

39:43.640 --> 39:44.960
you'd all better behave.

39:46.920 --> 39:48.480
-Take them away.
-Yes, sir.

39:49.160 --> 39:50.400
Play it by ear.

39:52.080 --> 39:53.200
Get out!

39:55.600 --> 39:57.240
-Keep moving forward!
-Move!

39:58.480 --> 39:59.400
Faster!

40:00.040 --> 40:00.880
-Faster!
-Supervisor Kang.

40:01.680 --> 40:03.120
Stop stalling!

40:03.200 --> 40:04.320
Move!

40:04.880 --> 40:06.440
The Master might be here too.

40:08.000 --> 40:08.840
Quick!

40:10.800 --> 40:11.680
Keep up!

40:12.600 --> 40:14.440
Move faster!

40:14.520 --> 40:16.840
Quit dawdling!

40:16.920 --> 40:17.840
Hurry up!

40:26.240 --> 40:27.280
Get up!

40:37.640 --> 40:38.720
Work!

40:39.320 --> 40:40.320
Move it!

40:41.840 --> 40:43.000
Get up!

40:43.680 --> 40:44.800
Keep moving!

40:45.360 --> 40:46.200
Cui Jia,

40:46.280 --> 40:48.520
assign them some hard labor.

40:49.040 --> 40:50.160
Yes, sir.

40:50.720 --> 40:51.560
Get to work!

40:55.480 --> 40:56.840
Hurry up!

40:58.400 --> 41:00.400
Why are you dragging your feet?

41:00.920 --> 41:02.240
-There!
-Get up!

41:02.320 --> 41:03.200
Get to work!

41:03.280 --> 41:04.120
-Move faster!
-Get up!

41:04.200 --> 41:06.000
Move! Hurry up!

41:08.680 --> 41:10.400
Go!

41:11.280 --> 41:13.040
Let me introduce someone.

41:13.120 --> 41:15.640
This is our Master Cui Shijiu.

41:15.720 --> 41:17.920
Treat him well.

41:19.360 --> 41:20.400
Master Shijiu!

41:21.520 --> 41:23.480
Cui Jia!

41:26.360 --> 41:27.200
Master Shijiu…

41:30.360 --> 41:32.680
Over here, if you don't work hard,

41:33.280 --> 41:34.520
you're as good as dead.

41:44.200 --> 41:45.160
Take this!

41:45.240 --> 41:46.160
Cui Jia!

41:46.240 --> 41:48.600
Master Shijiu!

41:55.000 --> 41:56.200
Alright.

41:56.280 --> 41:57.240
I'm leaving.

41:59.640 --> 42:00.640
So, even you end up here.

42:06.400 --> 42:07.840
Cui Jia, you'll meet a bad end!

42:11.640 --> 42:14.640
-Master Shijiu!
-Let go of me!

42:17.200 --> 42:18.440
Get up!

42:18.520 --> 42:19.440
Get to work!

42:19.520 --> 42:20.560
-Hurry up!
-Move!

42:20.640 --> 42:22.960
What are you looking at? Get to work!

42:24.520 --> 42:25.960
Didn't you hear my order?

42:31.760 --> 42:34.040
Supervisor Kang, we need to find a way

42:35.000 --> 42:36.560
to get these people out.

42:37.080 --> 42:38.000
I'll go look for the Master after that.
